==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**10 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use your usual cats to beat the Gory, something like [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] if the B.B.Bunnies trouble you. This stage's difficulty can be compared to late stages in the first chapter of Empire of Cats, as you can also rush the stage with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]].

